      "t": "Привет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hi.' Walking up to the host stand, Ilya greets Nastya. Nastya answers straight away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Привет, Илья.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hi, Ilya.' Nastya smiles and says hello back to him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ilya",
      "t": "Здесь была девушка в зеленом платье?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Was there a girl in a green dress here?' Ilya asks if she noticed a girl in a green dress in the dining room earlier.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Вообще да.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, actually.' Nastya thinks for a second and says yes, she actually did see her. Then Ilya replies.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ilya",
      "t": "Где она?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where is she?' Ilya eagerly asks where that girl went.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Я не знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't know.' Nastya shrugs and says she does not know.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ilya",
      "t": "Ты ее не видела?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You didn't see her?' Ilya asks if Nastya saw her walk out. And Nastya jumps in.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Странно, я не видела.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That's strange, I didn't see.' Nastya admits it is strange, because she never saw the girl leave.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ilya",
      "t": "Может, она ушла?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maybe she left?' Ilya wonders aloud if she slipped out while nobody was looking.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Может быть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maybe.' Nastya agrees that she might have left. Ilya answers straight away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "ilya",
      "t": "Мне нужно ее найти.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I need to find her.' Ilya says he really needs to track her down.",
